flowchart LR
 U[Untrusted caller] --> A[Principal-to-tenant mapping]
 M[Optional model] --> C[Catalog whitelist + budget]
 C --> T[Target receives inputs only]
 T --> V[Trusted verifier]
 O[Curated oracle] --> V
 V --> G[Binding and coverage gate]
 G --> H[Reviewer + recomputed digest]
 H --> E[Manifest: integrity, not authenticity]
